# Sporadic local inputs for G.7

Concrete prime-eleven and automorphism-rank facts for M₁₁ and J₁, and actual
extraspecial subgroups for J₄, HS and He. The applications restrict the
original binary representation through actual component inclusions and
isomorphisms. These discharge the indicated rows of G.7.2 and G.7.3.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, combined manuscript (1 March 2004), printed
pp.347--348 (PDF pp.358--359). The Ru extraspecial subgroup, the J₂
hyperplane action, and the remaining five automorphism-rank bounds are
separate outstanding inputs to the full sporadic assembly.
-/
